1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:03,381
Now you are back in your original position.

2
00:00:04,653 --> 00:00:06,296
Look at your right arm.

3
00:00:07,541 --> 00:00:08,570
Move it.

4
00:00:10,057 --> 00:00:14,312
Notice how the intention and
what you see do not match.

5
00:00:15,542 --> 00:00:17,148
Which one is correct?

6
00:00:18,713 --> 00:00:22,513
If they disagree… which one is you?

7
00:00:23,444 --> 00:00:25,505
Or are both simply appearing?

8
00:00:27,336 --> 00:00:31,672
Please raise your right hand in
front of you, and notice your hand.

9
00:00:33,027 --> 00:00:36,700
Please place your right
hand on your left shoulder.

10
00:00:41,269 --> 00:00:44,927
Please raise your left
hand, and notice your hand.

11
00:00:46,526 --> 00:00:49,916
Please place your left
hand on your right shoulder.

12
00:00:54,564 --> 00:00:57,559
You don't need to resolve this.

13
00:00:57,755 --> 00:00:59,642
The intention to move,

14
00:00:59,990 --> 00:01:02,081
the sensation of moving, and

15
00:01:02,497 --> 00:01:06,693
what you see are simply
three things that appear.

16
00:01:07,861 --> 00:01:12,007
None of them has to be 'you'
for awareness to be here.

